\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Guide me, O Thou great Jehovah,
\par Pilgrim through this barren land;
\par I am weak, but Thou art mighty;
\par Hold me with Thy powerful hand:
\par Bread of heaven!
\par Feed me now and evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Open Thou the crystal fountain,
\par Whence the healing stream shall flow;
\par Let the fiery, cloudy pillar
\par Lead me all my journey through:
\par Strong deliverer!
\par Be Thou still my help and shield.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When I tread the verge of Jordan,
\par Bid my anxious fears subside;
\par Death of deaths, and hell's destruction,
\par Land me safe on Caana's side:
\par Songs of praises
\par I will ever give to Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

